@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `hvac-nouns`

-- hvac-law-s7-s9-exemption-and-temporary-licence.l4 -- Law s 7 (exemption from parts of the
-- training) and s 9 (a temporary licence for a foreign expert).  Quoted from Hebrew Wikisource
-- rev 2947808 (unofficial); the gazette (Sefer HaChukim 3349 pp 183-184) has the same words.

§ `Section 7: Exemption from training`

-- (א) מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית רשאי לתת לבעל רישיון חשמל בתוקף, פטור מלימודי פרק החשמל במסגרת הכשרה כאמור בסעיף 6(א)(4); לעניין זה, ”בעל רישיון חשמל“ – בעל רישיון המנוי בפסקאות (1) עד (7) לתקנה 7 בתקנות החשמל (רישיונות), התשמ״ה–1985.
-- (ב) מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית רשאי לתת לבעל אישור עבודה בגובה בתוקף, פטור מלימודי פרק עבודה בגובה במסגרת הכשרה כאמור בסעיף 6(א)(4); לעניין זה, ”בעל אישור עבודה בגובה“ – בעל אישור המעיד כי קיבל הדרכה בעבודה בגובה כאמור בתקנות 5 ו־6 לתקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה), התשס״ז–2007.
-- (ג) מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית יפרסם באתר האינטרנט של המשרד הוראות בדבר אופן הגשת הבקשה לפטור לפי סעיף זה, והמסמכים שיש לצרף לה.

-- s 7(a), (b): who is eligible for the Director's exemption is a test; whether the Director
-- gives it is his permission ("רשאי").  Whether a licence is "valid", and what the Electricity
-- Regulations list in paragraphs (1) to (7) of regulation 7, are facts the caller supplies:
-- those instruments are outside the sources.
@ref Law s 7(a)
GIVEN e IS AN `Exemption candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(a): the candidate may be exempted from the electrical chapter` e MEANS
    e's `holds a valid electricity licence of a kind listed in paragraphs (1) to (7) of regulation 7 of the Electricity Regulations (Licences)`

@ref Law s 7(b)
GIVEN e IS AN `Exemption candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(b): the candidate may be exempted from the working-at-heights chapter` e MEANS
    e's `holds a valid working-at-heights approval under regulations 5 and 6 of the Work at Heights Regulations`

-- "רשאי לתת": a permission of a named actor.  An exemption not given is not a breach: with no
-- deadline stated the permission simply stands, and exercising it clears it (FULFILLED).
@ref Law s 7(a)
GIVEN e IS AN `Exemption candidate`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Party under the Law` `Act under the Law`
`s 7(a): the Director may exempt from the electrical chapter` e MEANS
    IF   `s 7(a): the candidate may be exempted from the electrical chapter` e
    THEN PARTY `the Director of the Vocational Training Division`
         MAY   `give an exemption from the electrical chapter of the training`
         HENCE FULFILLED
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref Law s 7(b)
GIVEN e IS AN `Exemption candidate`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Party under the Law` `Act under the Law`
`s 7(b): the Director may exempt from the working-at-heights chapter` e MEANS
    IF   `s 7(b): the candidate may be exempted from the working-at-heights chapter` e
    THEN PARTY `the Director of the Vocational Training Division`
         MAY   `give an exemption from the working-at-heights chapter of the training`
         HENCE FULFILLED
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- s 7(c): "יפרסם" -- the Director SHALL publish, on the Ministry's website, instructions on how
-- to apply for an exemption and which documents to attach.  A duty, with no time stated.
@ref Law s 7(c)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Party under the Law` `Act under the Law`
`s 7(c): the Director shall publish the instructions for applying for an exemption` MEANS
    PARTY `the Director of the Vocational Training Division`
    MUST  `publish the instructions for applying for an exemption`
    HENCE FULFILLED

§ `Section 9: A temporary licence for a foreign expert`

-- (א) על אף האמור בסעיפים 6 ו־8, הרשם רשאי לתת רישיון דרגה 3 זמני, למבקש ממדינת חוץ שמתקיימים לגביו התנאים המנויים להלן (בסעיף זה – מומחה זר), לתקופה שלא תעלה על שנה (בסעיף זה – רישיון זמני):
-- (1) הוא הוזמן לישראל לשם ביצוע עבודות במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר שתפוקת הקירור שלה מעל 70 קילו־ואט;
-- (2) הוא מוסמך לבצע עבודות במערכות קירור או מיזוג אוויר במדינת חוץ וביצע בשש השנים שקדמו להגשת הבקשה לרישיון זמני, התקנה או תחזוקה של מערכות קירור או מיזוג אוויר דומות למערכות שלשם התקנתן או תחזוקתן הוזמן לישראל;
-- (3) הרשם הכיר בו כבעל מוניטין וכמומחה בעל שם בתחומו.
-- (ב) הרשם רשאי לחדש את תוקפו של רישיון זמני לשתי תקופות נוספות שלא יעלו על שנה כל אחת.

-- s 9(a)(1): "הוזמן לישראל לשם ביצוע עבודות במערכת ... שתפוקת הקירור שלה מעל 70 קילו־ואט" --
-- ABOVE 70 kilowatts, so exactly 70 is not enough.
@ref Law s 9(a)(1)
GIVEN f IS A `Foreign expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9(a)(1): invited to work on a system of cooling output above 70 kilowatts` f MEANS
    f's `cooling output in kilowatts of the system he was invited to work on` GREATER THAN 70

-- s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and in the six years preceding the application he installed or
-- maintained similar systems.  The six years are tested by adding six years to the LATER-OR-EARLIER
-- performance date, never by subtracting from the application (the `Date` month-subtraction
-- footgun).  A performance exactly six years before the application counts (fork F-T5).
@ref Law s 9(a)(2)
GIVEN f IS A `Foreign expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and did similar work in the six years before the application` f MEANS
        f's `authorised to perform such work in a foreign state`
    AND CONSIDER f's `the latest date on which he installed or maintained similar systems`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST d  THEN
                d AT MOST f's `the date of the application for the temporary licence`
            AND `add years` d 6 AT LEAST f's `the date of the application for the temporary licence`

-- s 9(a)(3): "הרשם הכיר בו כבעל מוניטין וכמומחה בעל שם בתחומו" -- the Registrar recognised him.
-- A determination of the Registrar's, recorded; not computed from the expert's record.
@ref Law s 9(a)(3)
GIVEN f IS A `Foreign expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9(a)(3): the Registrar recognised him as reputed and renowned` f MEANS
    f's `recognised by the Registrar as a reputed and renowned expert`

@ref Law s 9(a)
GIVEN f IS A `Foreign expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` f MEANS
        f's `applying from a foreign state`
    AND `s 9(a)(1): invited to work on a system of cooling output above 70 kilowatts` f
    AND `s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and did similar work in the six years before the application` f
    AND `s 9(a)(3): the Registrar recognised him as reputed and renowned` f

-- "רשאי לתת רישיון דרגה 3 זמני ... לתקופה שלא תעלה על שנה": a permission of the Registrar,
-- "notwithstanding ss 6 and 8" (so the Second Schedule and the five-year term do not apply).
@ref Law s 9(a)
GIVEN f IS A `Foreign expert`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Party under the Law` `Act under the Law`
`s 9(a): the Registrar may give a temporary Grade 3 licence to` f MEANS
    IF   `s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` f
    THEN PARTY `the Registrar`
         MAY   `give a temporary Grade 3 licence to the foreign expert`
         HENCE FULFILLED
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- A temporary licence is for a period "not exceeding a year": the period beginning on one day
-- may end on that day one year later at the latest.
@ref Law s 9(a): "לתקופה שלא תעלה על שנה"; s 9(b): "שלא יעלו על שנה כל אחת"
GIVEN start IS A DATE
      end   IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9: a period from` start `to` end `does not exceed one year` MEANS
    end AT MOST `add years` start 1

-- s 9(b): "לחדש ... לשתי תקופות נוספות" -- two further periods, no more.  The number of renewals
-- already given is a fact.
@ref Law s 9(b)
GIVEN `the renewals already given` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9(b): a further renewal is open given these renewals already given:` `the renewals already given` MEANS
    `the renewals already given` LESS THAN 2

@ref Law s 9(b)
GIVEN `the renewals already given` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Party under the Law` `Act under the Law`
`s 9(b): the Registrar may renew a temporary licence given these renewals already given:` `the renewals already given` MEANS
    IF   `s 9(b): a further renewal is open given these renewals already given:` `the renewals already given`
    THEN PARTY `the Registrar`
         MAY   `renew the temporary licence`
         HENCE FULFILLED
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- The longest a temporary licence can last: the first period and two renewals, each at most a
-- year, run back to back.
@ref Law s 9(a), (b)
GIVEN start IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the latest last day of a temporary licence that began on` start MEANS
    `add years` start 3
